{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"instancetype"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"definitionWithUserDefaultsKeyNamesString:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSString"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"keyNamesString"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A string with the key names separated by semi-colons. Example string: @“firstName;lastName”. Property groups can also be defined in the string using the following format: @“Personal Details:(firstName, lastName); Address:(street, state, country)”. The group title can also be ommitted to create a group with no title. For example: @”:(firstName, lastName)”.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"keyNamesString"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"By default, all property definitions generated for the given keyNames will have a type of SCPropertyTypeTextField. This can be fully customized after initialization.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key names string syntax options:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"@“key1;key2;key3;…”"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"@“group1 header:(key1, key2,…):group1 footer;group2…”"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCUserDefaultsDefinition"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCUserDefaultsDefinition\/definitionWithUserDefaultsKeyNamesString:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"}